OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 11 FEB
OL,4,G1700FIn Tune
OL,5,     GPetroc Trelawny is joined by
OL,6,     GNeave Trio for a live
OL,7,     Gperformance. There is also live
OL,8,     Gmusic from saxophonist David
OL,9,     GZucchi and accordionist Inigo
OL,10,     GMikeleiz-Berrade - the MZ Duo.
OL,11,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,12,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,13,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
OL,14,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,15,     GThe BBC Philharmonic Orchestra's
OL,16,     GPrincipal Guest Conductor, Anja
OL,17,     GBihlmaier, is joined by Jennifer
OL,18,     GJohnston and Christopher Purves
OL,19,     Gto unlock the secrets of Duke
OL,20,     GBluebeard's Castle.
